concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-act-sec-28 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "28 Section 28"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-28 ;
    values:originalText "(1) Section 32 of the Principal Act is amended by omitting paragraph (1) (c) and substituting the following paragraph: \"(c) an order for the examination on oath before the court or the Registrar of the court of any person, including: (i) the owner of property subject to the restraining order (in this paragraph called the 'owner'); or (ii) the defendant; about the affairs (including the nature and location of any property) of: (iii) anyone else who is either the owner or the defendant, or both; and (iv) if the person to be examined is either the owner or the defendant, or both—that person; and\". (2) The amendment made by subsection (1) applies in relation to restraining orders made before or after the commencement of this section." ;
    skos:definition "(1) Section 32 of the Principal Act is amended by omitting paragraph (1) (c) and substituting the following paragraph: \"(c) an order for the examination on oath before the court or the Registrar of the court of any person, including: (i) the owner of property subject to the restraining order (in this paragraph called the 'owner'); or (ii) the defendant; about the affairs (including the nature and location of any property) of: (iii) anyone else who is either the owner or the defendant, or both; and (iv) if the person to be examined is either the owner or the defendant, or both—that person; and\". (2) The amendment made by subsection (1) applies in relation to restraining orders made before or after the commencement of this section."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "aeb9aa50207d3bc5fbb0c89d950d098ae3eda4d29911b1dde9c6d88db1a4583a" ;
    cof:pageNumber "12"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-act-sec-28-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-act-sec-28-ss-2 ;
